      "heading": "Two sets of records",
      "id": "P002",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "The court finished hearing the Securities and Exchange Commission witness on corporate filings, then heard a PhilGEPS official identify procurement records for 49 GenCorp awards. The central question remained what those records can show about Vice President Sara Duterte's declared business interests."
    },
