      "heading": "The SEC testimony",
      "id": "P003",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "SEC representative Gerardo del Rosario said GenCorp's filings did not list Duterte, while Metro City Chow Foods filings from 2018 through 2025 listed her as a director and stockholder. He described JTC Group as holding 54.99 percent of GenCorp, but his department did not have JTC's beneficial ownership declaration. Possible trust or layered ownership arrangements remained possibilities, not findings established by his records."
