      "heading": "What senators pressed",
      "id": "P004",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "Senator Francis Pangilinan pressed the question of who ultimately owned JTC, and proposed seeking its records; the chair took that proposal under advisement. Senator Bam Aquino asked what role Duterte actually held in GenCorp. Del Rosario could not establish that role from the filings, and Aquino suggested someone with direct knowledge might have to explain it. Other senator-judges tested what dividend records, passive shareholding, and a public official's personal asset declaration could establish."
    },
