      "heading": "The PhilGEPS records",
      "id": "P005",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "PhilGEPS division chief Rendell Sopeña said a search under GenCorp's merchant name found 49 awarded contracts: one from OWWA Region 11, 33 from PhilHealth Region 11, and 15 from the City of Davao. His team extracted 231 related documents, spanning 484 printed pages. He certified the printouts as representations of records in the PhilGEPS repository."
