      "heading": "The parties' positions",
      "id": "P006",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "The prosecution linked the procurement awards to its allegation that Duterte failed to divest business and financial interests. The defense disputed the link, objected to conclusions drawn from the documents, and said some cited Davao awards came after she had left city office. Defense counsel also asked for copies and time to inspect the newly supplied PhilGEPS material before cross-examination."
    },
