      "heading": "Court action and next sittings",
      "id": "P007",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "The chair allowed the PhilGEPS examination to proceed, directed copies and later exhibit marking for both sides, and set Sopeña's possible cross-examination for September 28. On the prosecution's motion, the chair took judicial notice of the cited laws' text while reserving their interpretation and application. The court also set September 23 for oral argument and a planned vote on a pending motion or appeal concerning Senator Erwin Tulfo. None of those steps resolved the disputed meaning of the corporate and procurement records."
